From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 22:15:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Design system: additions for the happycynic.com product shelf

- display-xl type style (72px, 40px on phones) for the happycynic.com
  home hero only, via hc-hero__title--xl
- SiteHeader compact variant (hc-header--compact): logo left, nav right
- ProductPanel (hc-panel): one product across the full width
- DoesDoesnt (hc-dd): what a product does and refuses to do
- ThemeToggle (hc-theme-toggle) and a Themes section: follow the system
  appearance, let the visitor override it, remember the choice

Additive only; no existing class or token changes meaning. Exported
from the design-system editor (tokens.json, bundle.css, component
READMEs) with tokens.css, tokens.md and README.md updated to match.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TqzRgBTn3vSvbb1swBihtT
